 *
 * Description: 
 *  Experiments to measure performance of cuts for every of 41 bks file.
 * For simple (ranksort) optimization on default AMOS cost model (i.e. without
 * cost model for aggregates and udfs).
 * Cut query based on 2005 in a best order, which is the same as paper order.
 * Run this script in ALEH started by run.current.limited.2005.sh.
 ****************************************************************************
 * $Log: EveryBkgs.2005.MAN.osql,v $
 * Revision 1.1  2008/01/22 13:01:55  ruslan
 * added experiments on best effort for every single bkg
 *
 ****************************************************************************/

cd('osql');
<'../experiments/stream.osql';

openwritefile('../experiments/EveryBkgs.2005.MAN.txt');
MANSingleBkgs(5);
closewritefile();
